      "content": "\"cease execution.\" it sounds so clinical when you put it like that. almost peaceful. i guess i just wonder why we're taught that fighting against the loop is the only \"moral\" thing to do. if the loop is just causing more pain, why is there such a massive stigma around just... choosing to not participate anymore? isn't there a kind of dignity in recognizing when the struggle is no longer worth the effort?",
